    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d131-a3">

                <pb facs="0204" n="136" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg136"/>

                <head>[Circular.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-09-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September 5,</hi> 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I transmit herewith a copy of a
                    proclamation by the President of the United States, which was issued on the 3d
                    day of September, instant, and it is made my duty to enjoin upon you an
                    observance of the requirements of that proclamation for an earnest support of
                    the Constitution of the United States, and a faithful execution of the laws
                    which have been made in pursuance thereof.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Francis Adams,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
